ssage was added to begin with.=C2=A0 =C2=A0=C2=A0</div><div>=C2=A0</div><bl=
ockquote class=3D"gmail_quote" style=3D"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-lef=
t:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex">
&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0If all this is true, then the 3.5 round EAP-TLS goal is im=
possible.<br>
